Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbns": ["9780140328721"]
}

### B15. Importar sin ISBN (400 Zod)
POST http://localhost:8000/books/import
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbns": []
